    "heading": "A little bit more about me!",
    "paragraphs": [
      "Growing up in a family business, I’ve always had a self-starting mindset—from leading my family business’s social media and marketing strategy when there was none, to freelancing social media and design work in high school. I use that self-starting attitude to foster design community in my space, starting my own design club in high school, running my college’s flagship hackathon club, and running my own events to fill education gaps and give students industry insight.",
